  "description": "Lee Changyeon is a trashy top whose hobby is “opening up” even virgins to the point of anal sex, and whose life motto is never looking twice at a man he’s already slept with.\nBut then, something strikes him like a bolt from the blue.\nEvery time he climaxes, his dick gets smaller because of a curse…!! And the way to break this damned curse is… receiving semen all the way in his ass??\nFine. Whatever. Sex is sex anyway, right? What’s the big deal about getting fucked?\nAs Changyeon immediately sets out searching for someone well-endowed, a cute and tiny-looking man named Boo Silhan appears before him.\nSilhan confidently claims he can break Changyeon’s curse, but Changyeon pushes him away because he seems far too small and delicate.\nCompletely unaware that Silhan is actually hiding the very “huge package” Changyeon has been searching for all along…\nA fiery and ridiculous romance between Silhan, who wants Changyeon’s heart, and Changyeon, who only wants a big dick!\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/culseofdick)",
